{
 "id": "biology-replace-0001",
 "notes": "The disease target and the tumour site are stored by name (a fact about the pancreas) or through the organ that makes insulin (a rule over produced_by_organ). q1's original 'no' needs the pancreas to lie outside the neck: the pancreas in the abdomen and 'one body region per organ' are encoded as firm presupposed facts (the delete mirror states the first).",
 "relations": {
  "destroys_cells_in": [],
